title: Where the objects live
title-zh: 对象存放在哪里
---
# A recipes repository with two commits
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+hidden pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
> git add pancakes.md
> git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
$ ls .git
$ ls .git/objects
$ ls .git/objects/87
$ git cat-file -t 871d830f4cec82e60e46ad67ec042c33f215a834
